=== PART 1 -- path(G) >= path(G') is FREE; all the content is the '+ h' ===
  G' is an INDUCED subgraph of G, so an induced path of G' is an induced path of
  G.  Hence path(G) >= path(G') with no hypotheses at all.  Verified below on
  every graph this file builds, so the claim under test is only the '+ h'.

